ed":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1129629440","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1515#issuecomment-1129629440","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1515","id":1129629440,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM5DVMcA","user":{"login":"irazairspan","id":82235758,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMjM1NzU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82235758?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/irazairspan","html_url":"https://github.com/irazairspan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irazairspan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irazairspan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irazairspan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irazairspan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irazairspan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irazairspan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irazairspan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irazairspan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irazairspan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-05-18T06:40:07Z","updated_at":"2022-05-18T06:40:07Z","body":"I tested again on 17-May but issue is still there. Please note that I am installing the Open5Gs using the QuickStart guidelines from sudo add-apt-repository ppa:open5gs/latest.  I installed Open5Gs from ppa:open5gs/latest on Sunday May-15th. So I am NOT cloning the main branch and building from sources. Is there a difference here between ppa:open5gs/latest  and Main Branch?\r\nI am attaching logs and wireshark captures of the issue from 17-May. You have 2 wireshark captures: on the Open5Gs machine itself and mirror port between Open5Gs and gNodeB. Since I am using a real gNodeB then of course the communication is external to the machine.\r\nComparing to your wireshark main-bb4a8f3.pcapng.tar.gz I can see you are using IPv4 addresses for gNodeB and AMF, where as my setup has IPv6 addresses for gNodeB and AMF (UE is still getting IPv4 address). Maybe the issue I am seeing is specific to IPv6 addresses of gNodeB?\r\nOne more thing which is strange to me from your wireshark main-bb4a8f3.pcapng.tar.gz is that NG-Setup from the 2 gNodeBs has the SAME gNodeB-ID for both gNodeB IP 127.0.0.1 and gNodeB IP 127.0.0.100. This is really strange to me because the AMF (and same for MME) needs a 1-to-1 mapping between gNodeB IP address and gNodeB-ID.  In such a scenario where 2 different gNodeBs are declaring in NG-Setup Request the SAME gNodeB-ID typically what happens is that the 5G Cores sends an SCTP Abort to the first gNodeB or BOTH gNodeBs. Because this type of situation confuses the AMF. Same behavior for MME.\r\n[open5gs_Airpsan_log_17_May_2022.zip](https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/files/8713796/open5gs_Airpsan_log_17_May_2022.zip)\r\n  \r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1129629440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1129981084","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1515#issuecomment-1129981084","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1515","id":1129981084,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM5DWiSc","user":{"login":"acetcom","id":4222492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjI0OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4222492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom","html_url":"https://github.com/acetcom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.g